\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Component roofline. Arithmetic intensity of the main components of Llama-3.1-8B (public configuration; 4-bit weights, 8-bit KV cache, 2k context) against the rooflines of three representative platform classes (nominal parameters in \cref  {tab:modelparams}); points are placed on the phone-SoC roof. Batch-1 decode components (GEMV, attention) lie deep in the memory-bound region (shaded) of every platform, whereas prefill and batched decode reach the compute roof. Computed by the released script (\ref  {app:model}).}}{8}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
