\newlabel{fig:timeline}{{7}{11}{Evolution of the design census ($n=\ncensus $; 2026 counts up to the September cut-off). (a) Designs per year by evidence level: measured silicon has become the largest category. (b) Designs per year by power class: the share of milliwatt and single-watt designs grows as deployment descends to the edge}{figure.7}{}}
\newlabel{fig:timeline@cref}{{[figure][7][]7}{[1][10][]11}}
