\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Where the latency of one decode token goes. (a) Per-component share for Llama-3.2-1B (public configuration) at a 2k-token context in four representative configurations (\cref  {tab:modelparams}); the total per-token time is printed beside each bar. (b) Non-GEMM share in the weight-resident configuration as a function of the non-GEMM throughput, for three context lengths; the two streamed configurations are marked for reference. The model is a first-order upper bound on exposed non-GEMM latency (no overlap); it replaces illustrative breakdowns with counts that follow from the model configuration and can be recomputed for any model and platform with the released script.}}{14}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
