\newlabel{tab:rope}{{6}{20}{Catalogue of hardware work that implements, engineers, or offloads rotary positional encoding (literature to September 2026). Role: \emph {dedicated} = RoPE is the primary object; \emph {embedded} = RoPE unit inside a larger accelerator; \emph {offload} = RoPE deliberately executed elsewhere. ``n/s'' = not stated in the source. Regime classes as in \cref {sec:scope}; DC = data-center scale}{table.6}{}}
