\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces A decision procedure for edge LLM accelerator design distilled from the survey. Each question is answered with the first-order model of \cref  {sec:model} for the target model, context, and platform; each leaf lists the techniques that address the corresponding binding constraint and the section that surveys them. Because fixing one constraint exposes the next, the procedure is iterated: a design that resolves weight streaming typically re-enters at the KV or non-GEMM question.}}{26}{figure.12}\protected@file@percent }
